  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Improve Lands and Maritime Governance in Solomon Islands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment aims to promote improved lands and maritime governance outcomes in the Solomon Islands. Through this investment, Australia supports the Solomon Islands Lands Commission and Maritime Authority to deliver on key Solomon Island Government priorities including customary land recording and improving the safety and energy efficiency of maritime vessels.</narrative>
  </description>
